  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Banking and Financial Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activities to be undertaken will aim at helping the Superintendency and the Banco Central de Reserva address in a comprehensive way continued risks in the banking sector, particularly non-credit risks such as market risks and various types of liquidity risks. This involves improving the on and off-site examination functions and integrating the process to provide seamless oversight and improved monitoring of the risks in the banking system, including an Early Warning System (EWS). CAMELS indicators should be revised to more accurately reflect safe and sound standards.</narrative>
  </description>
